  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong><span><span><span style=\"font-size:36px\">要執行此模組，您也需要安裝 geckolib 插件！</span>&nbsp;</span></span></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>目前共有 12 種新生物（包含 3.0 更新）：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>元素生物</strong> - 生成於<strong>平原</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>- 150 顆心</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/758/487/2023-11-13_14.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"211\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>魔力哨兵</strong> - 無生成限制</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;- 10 顆心</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/758/489/2023-11-13_14.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"211\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>魔力管理者</strong> - 無生成限制</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; - 7 顆心</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/758/490/2023-11-13_14.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"211\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>狂狐</strong> - 生成於<strong>針葉林</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>- 12 顆心</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/758/491/2023-11-13_14.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"211\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>幼龍</strong> - 生成於<strong>沙漠</strong>和<strong>莽原</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>- 15 顆心</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/758/492/2023-11-13_14.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"211\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>蠑螈</strong> - 生成於<strong>紅樹林沼澤</strong>、<strong>黑森林</strong>和<strong>叢林</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>- 50 顆心</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/758/493/2023-11-13_14.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"211\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">此模組還提供一些新物品，幫助您的冒險旅程（自 2.0 更新以來，目前共有 6 種新物品和 6 種新武器）</span></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#800080\">更新 2.0 受污染的火焰 </span>(已發布)</span></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>新增 4 種生物：</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>螳螂蟲</strong> - 生成於<strong>叢林</strong>、<strong>莽原</strong>和<strong>平原</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>- 12 顆心</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/759/33/2023-11-14_16.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"211\"></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>受污染的火焰</strong> - 無生成限制</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;- 100 顆心</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/759/32/2023-11-14_16.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"211\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;<strong>邪教徒</strong> - 生成於<strong>終界</strong>和<strong>平原</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;- 20 顆心<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/759/482/2023-11-15_13.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"211\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>哀嚎靈魂</strong> - 生成於<strong>終界</strong>和<strong>靈魂砂谷</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>- 20 顆心</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/759/483/2023-11-15_13.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"211\"></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f60\">更新 3.0 來自天際的回響</span>&nbsp;(已發布)</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>新增更多生物、結構與物品。</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/761/325/echosfromabove.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"239\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">戈摩</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;- 生成於<strong>沙漠</strong>和<strong>惡地</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; - 20 顆心</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/763/320/2023-11-23_17.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"211\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">騎士</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;- 無生成限制</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; - 25 顆心</span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/763/321/2023-11-23_17.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"211\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f00\">更新 4.0 大災變傳奇</span> (即將推出)</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">新增成就、結構、盔甲、物品、武器和生物等內容</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/768/32/310/172/update-4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"200\"></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>初火守護者</strong> - 無生成限制</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;- 400 顆心</span></p><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/771/752/310/172/2023-12-09_14.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"399\" height=\"211\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>鎚頭蟻</strong> - 僅在蟻丘中出現</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;- 15 顆心</span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/771/759/310/172/2023-12-09_14.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"401\" height=\"212\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>遊蕩螳螂蟲</strong> - 無生成限制 !!開發中!!</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;- 免疫傷害</span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/771/761/310/172/2023-12-09_14.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"401\" height=\"212\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>機械蜘蛛</strong> - 僅在小行星中出現 !!開發中!!</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;- 免疫傷害</span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/771/760/310/172/2023-12-09_14.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"401\" height=\"212\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>寒地螳螂</strong> - 僅生成於寒冷生態系</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;- 12 顆心</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/771/755/310/172/2023-12-09_14.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"399\" height=\"211\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>維德</strong> - 無生成限制</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;- 20 顆心</span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/771/753/310/172/2023-12-09_14.png\" width=\"401\" height=\"212\"></p>",
